  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migrants as Messengers Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of Migrants as Messengers Phase 2 is to empower young people (17-25 years old) in West Africa to make informed migration-related decisions. The project builds on the success of Migrants as Messenger Phase 1 (November 2017-March 2019). The project uses innovative communication tools and peer-to-peer messaging to raise awareness about the risks associated with irregular migration and promotes safe and orderly migration. A total of four impact evaluations will be conducted during project implementation to measure the impact, while continuous monitoring and evaluation will feed into activity design.</narrative>
  </description>
